    "walletDetail.xaman.description": "Xaman (formerly XUMM) is the premier mobile wallet for the XRP Ledger. Built by XRPL Labs, it offers the most comprehensive XRPL experience with support for all native features including the DEX, NFTs, AMM, and trustlines. It's completely free and designed specifically for the XRP Ledger ecosystem.",
