    "walletDetail.ledger.tagline": "Industry-Leading Hardware Security",
    "walletDetail.ledger.description": "Ledger is the most trusted name in hardware wallets. The Nano X offers Bluetooth connectivity for mobile use, a secure element chip for key storage, and supports over 5,500 cryptocurrencies including XRP. It's the gold standard for securing significant crypto holdings.",
